    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλῐ-ώτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
